png", "id": "2007695566789254", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619159_2007695570122587_7204963322755721350_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=APQJDkygrdgQ7kNvwFcUg3K&_nc_oc=Adqk08obJ16U4U2WMtjo00twnzkR_WXKINjPkgpe7jVyzlNEi-MgvMjikJnYF5Mo-UM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBUoibnDO9ehN080EVynoYQOntvHLi7cCivNPRrRuEK9g&oe=6A64C986"}, {"file_name": "2k19.png", "id": "4525495801067091", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620965_4525495804400424_803385464731135205_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xDVAjnxnkLMQ7kNvwGjkrXa&_nc_oc=Adp4Xe0wPCsyoqFRD4Bhodd1bpAcQAgKubTDRk4tgV6QFLoyXtTCdFlA3iGMEzyFhm4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQA6ORNkWaCs1KrKBuucXf4DlBKR0ClhzO1DEF86TGgQEg&oe=6A64C6BF"}, {"file_name": "2k27.png", "id": "1022086527023546", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/595143057_1022086530356879_8176922957643609569_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qesBZVyhGsoQ7kNvwH3YN7u&_nc_oc=Ado7RGjk9Ozkg5-BjULDBOqd7KtdiNe3Z-wlWXBdflQ6mK5TAIBfFB3h67KjQFemsE4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCFLBdbSBUiRkJDYnWk-mTZ-DA-BLmerhTO3CvIYi2LlQ&oe=6A64A676"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2K.png", "id": "1042090875446512", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619672_1042090878779845_1119689535618184987_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=N7UxHCFRBi8Q7kNvwHgMdDA&_nc_oc=AdoESQ0O9BEiYXU_fOeLPjW_nEtl5mf5y-Cgt_AMrpJpuH2bqtydwdfD4oE2gUF0SFc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQB3b6_QDvKU06Iffq9jI3oSGWMCZGrZisVCs-cKRY-gMw&oe=6A649F0C"}, "display_name": "The Cinder Pact", "keywords": ["Rogue", "Coop", "Hangout", "Social", "Multiplayer"], "long_description": "STRATEGIC CO-OP RPG: SURVIVE THE HORDE\n\nYour journey begins with intense hold-the-line battles, quickly opening up to diverse theme dungeons and complex mazes. This is a true Class-Based RPG where ranged firepower, class synergy, and mana management dictate survival. Team up and bond with players worldwide in the ultimate social dungeon-crawling experience!  \n\nTHE FOUR LEGENDS\n\nDefine the battlefield with unique primary attacks and two active skills:  The Armored: Frontline DPS with heavy firepower and raw physical destruction.  The Healer: Team core. Channel holy light to sustain allies and turn the tide.  The Mechanic: Technology master. Deploy tactical gadgets and unleash stunning electrical arcs.  The Summoner: Void commander. Call forth loyal minions and manipulate dark energies.  \n\nCYAN CRYSTAL JADE & PROGRESSION\n\nConquer deep labyrinths to harvest Cyan Crystal Jade, the core material needed to ascend your character. Customize your build through 7 distinct attributes: ATK, Max HP, Max MP, DEF, Movement Speed, and specialized Skill Power (Skill 1 & Skill 2). Manage your Mana (MP) wisely\u2014every cast is a tactical decision.  \n\nZERO GRIND, ALL THRILLS\n\nFast-Start: Complete the 10-minute tutorial and jump directly to Level 5, unlocking your first core skill.  Epic Scale: Brace for massive, multi-wave assaults pushing teamwork and social coordination to the limit.  True F2P: No pay-to-win. Only high-quality, full-model Avatar skins are for sale to showcase your style in social hubs.  ", "short_description": "Dive into a 4-player VR Co-op RPG! Choose from 4 unique classes, master powerful ranged skills, and conquer evolving labyrinths and dungeons. Experience deep RPG mechanics and a vibrant social hub in this 100% Free-to-Play adventure."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://dreamland.zmvr.com/TheCinderPact.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "App Lab", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://dreamland.zmvr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags":